<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,784.66 pts.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 6,784.66 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange finished officially at 6,784.66 points, up 53.09, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 4.15 billion forints.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
